client -> nginx -> uvicorn -> fastapi

/etc/nginx/nginx.conf
server {
 listen 80;
 server_name _;
 location /static/ { 
    alias /path/static;
 }
 location /api {
    proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8000;
    proxy_set_header Host $host;
    proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
 }
}

uvicorn main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000 --worker 4

nginx listen on 80 for frontend, uvicorn listen on 8000 for backend api

